WEBVTT

00:28.510 --> 00:30.820
I vow to follow your teachings

00:31.800 --> 00:35.270
and dedicate my very being to 
walking the path of the Hero.

00:36.680 --> 00:39.600
Such is the will of our Lord Demis.

00:39.800 --> 00:40.550
Hey...

00:43.900 --> 00:45.170
There you are.

00:48.840 --> 00:50.940
Ljubo, who is that?

00:50.940 --> 00:53.990
Let me introduce you to our newest comrade.

00:53.990 --> 00:57.200
My name is Escarlata. Please call me Esta.

00:57.460 --> 00:58.720
"Esta"?

00:58.720 --> 01:00.760
As in Lady Esta,

01:00.760 --> 01:04.660
the masked knight who defeated Altra of the
 Water, general of the demon lord's army?!

01:04.930 --> 01:08.420
Yes, that would be me. 
But I have no need for honorifics.

01:08.720 --> 01:11.920
I understand. I am Van of Flamberge.

01:12.430 --> 01:13.920
Please call me Van.

01:13.920 --> 01:16.930
"Flamberge"? Are you perhaps...

01:17.160 --> 01:20.070
Indeed, he is the eighth 
prince and a survivor

01:20.070 --> 01:23.700
of the Kingdom of Flamberge, which was 
destroyed by the demon lord's invasion.

01:23.700 --> 01:26.100
The prince of a fallen 
country becomes the Hero.

01:26.530 --> 01:28.940
It is surely the Almighty's will.

01:29.270 --> 01:32.800
I am certain Lord Demis 
has brought you to me.

01:32.800 --> 01:35.690
It will be a pleasure to 
fight alongside you, Esta.

01:36.400 --> 01:38.230
Likewise.

01:39.000 --> 01:40.850
You should introduce yourself, too.

01:43.330 --> 01:46.910
I'm Lavender! Van's closest confidant,

01:46.910 --> 01:48.540
and his partner!

01:48.540 --> 01:50.790
Our party is thus complete.

01:51.130 --> 01:55.350
Let's forge a tale where 
the Hero saves our world.

02:10.230 --> 02:16.940
<b>Banished from the Hero's Party,
I Decided to Live a Quiet Life in the Countryside 2nd</b>

03:27.510 --> 03:32.440
<b>Let's Go On a Quiet Little Journey</b>

03:32.440 --> 03:36.780
So, uh, I told you where 
they are. Can I go yet?

03:36.780 --> 03:41.250
No. I don't know whether 
you've told me the truth yet.

03:41.250 --> 03:42.990
And you gave me your word, did you not?

03:47.690 --> 03:50.470
Do you really know the Champion Rit?

03:50.470 --> 03:52.410
How about the man with her?

03:52.410 --> 03:54.540
Yeah. The two of them are my besties.

03:56.420 --> 03:59.460
Will you take me to them, then?

03:59.810 --> 04:03.690
You betcha. But only if 
you show me a good time...

04:03.690 --> 04:04.510
Huh?

04:11.680 --> 04:16.810
They said to be wary of hot women and 
drinking too much. I should've listened.

04:16.810 --> 04:19.020
Keep walking. We've got places to be.

04:19.020 --> 04:20.110
Yeah, yeah.

04:22.150 --> 04:26.410
We're adventurers. 
We're here to meet some old friends.

04:26.760 --> 04:28.910
Adventurers, eh?

04:34.920 --> 04:36.350
You may pass.

04:36.350 --> 04:37.420
Thank you.

04:41.160 --> 04:43.630
<i>Good thing Zoltan's security is so lax.</i>

04:45.000 --> 04:45.720
Wait...

05:10.190 --> 05:11.620
What's the holdup, Ruti?

05:12.020 --> 05:13.150
Big Brother.

05:19.030 --> 05:20.290
Someone's in a good mood.

05:20.290 --> 05:22.800
Yep. This is a first for me, after all.

05:23.060 --> 05:24.340
In what way?

05:24.340 --> 05:27.050
I've only ever gone adventuring 
as the Hero before.

05:27.610 --> 05:29.390
But this time, it's different.

05:29.390 --> 05:31.230
This is the first time 
we've made a journey

05:31.230 --> 05:34.330
that isn't related to fighting.

05:34.330 --> 05:35.430
And...

05:35.930 --> 05:38.810
That makes me so happy, 
words can't begin to describe it!

05:39.080 --> 05:40.310
Ruti...

05:42.830 --> 05:47.850
<i>We're headed to the mountain range 
called the Wall at the World's End.</i>

05:48.380 --> 05:52.990
<i>There are no battles in store for us, 
unlike when we were in the Hero's party.</i>

05:53.490 --> 05:55.500
<i>It's sure to be a chill, quiet journey.</i>

05:55.500 --> 05:57.800
What're you standing around for? Hurry up!

05:57.800 --> 06:00.960
Right. Let's take a break 
after we've walked some more.

06:00.960 --> 06:01.780
Sure!

06:08.430 --> 06:09.390
Boy...

06:09.390 --> 06:11.590
The Wall is an obstacle dreaded by many,

06:11.590 --> 06:15.650
but you're going there to 
make an engagement ring?

06:15.650 --> 06:18.140
You truly are a crazy lot.

06:18.420 --> 06:21.150
I just really want a blue sapphire.

06:21.600 --> 06:24.310
I think it would match 
the color of Rit's eyes.

06:24.310 --> 06:25.620
Oho?

06:25.620 --> 06:29.530
They're rare stones, but the 
gem giants probably have some.

06:29.530 --> 06:32.000
I was hoping they might sell me one.

06:32.000 --> 06:35.870
It's a gift I can only give once in a lifetime, 
so I don't wanna make any compromises.

06:37.490 --> 06:39.330
O-Once in a lifetime, huh?

06:39.590 --> 06:41.080
O-Obviously!

06:41.310 --> 06:43.570
Sheesh. Ever the lovebirds.

06:43.570 --> 06:47.590
You're one to talk, Mogrim. 
You joined us for Mink, too.

06:47.590 --> 06:49.640
For your wife?

06:49.640 --> 06:52.170
Oh, I guess I never told you.

06:52.170 --> 06:53.970
My missus is pregnant, you see.

06:55.270 --> 06:56.350
Congratulations!

06:56.350 --> 06:58.290
Thanks.

06:58.290 --> 07:02.730
The doc said it might come down to surgery 
and taking the child out of her belly.

07:03.040 --> 07:06.330
I want to do everything I can for her,

07:06.330 --> 07:10.270
but all I'm good at is hammering.

07:10.270 --> 07:13.740
That's why I want to make a 
knife out of earth crystal.

07:14.160 --> 07:16.170
Why earth crystal?

07:16.170 --> 07:20.680
Its blades are famous for being so sharp 
you don't even realize you've been cut.

07:20.680 --> 07:23.250
That should ease her burden.

07:23.850 --> 07:29.720
It's a pretty rare material, 
but the gem giants might have some.

07:29.720 --> 07:33.510
I'm glad I could join you on your journey.

07:35.130 --> 07:37.720
Everyone here is thinking of someone, I see.

07:38.820 --> 07:39.810
So am I.

07:40.520 --> 07:45.020
Big Brother, you went on adventures and 
faced countless dangers for my sake.

07:45.020 --> 07:49.830
But I've never once done the same for you.

07:50.390 --> 07:53.910
So, this time, I want to support you.

07:54.150 --> 07:55.260
Ruti.

08:04.300 --> 08:05.120
Stop.

08:06.270 --> 08:08.340
Is that goblins I smell?

08:08.590 --> 08:11.970
It must be a horde that steals 
food and valuables from travelers.

08:11.970 --> 08:15.310
I would've liked to avoid fighting, 
but so much for that.

08:27.770 --> 08:31.030
That sword I forged sure can 
cut through anything! Go me!

08:43.600 --> 08:45.460
That should be all of them.

08:45.460 --> 08:49.250
Yeah. None observing from a distance, either.

08:50.220 --> 08:52.010
What is it, Mogrim?

08:52.010 --> 08:56.260
It was a long time ago now, 
but I made this spear.

08:56.260 --> 09:00.970
I see... Its original owner must've 
fallen prey to the goblins.

09:02.620 --> 09:04.850
<i>This world is rife with violence.</i>

09:05.600 --> 09:09.360
<i>There isn't a single person here 
who can live a life free of battle.</i>

09:09.800 --> 09:14.360
<i>The Almighty Demis grants a 
Divine Blessing to all living things,</i>

09:15.100 --> 09:21.660
<i>and leveling it up requires battling and 
slaying someone who has a Blessing.</i>

09:22.220 --> 09:23.450
Say, Big Brother...

09:24.300 --> 09:29.130
I've turned my back on a life 
of combat. Was I wrong to?

09:29.830 --> 09:34.590
<i>Ruti has the Blessing of the Hero,
 said to be the most powerful in the world.</i>

09:35.130 --> 09:39.470
No, you weren't. 
You've finally got your life back.

09:39.470 --> 09:40.640
Don't feel bad about it.

09:41.690 --> 09:43.640
Yeah. But...

09:47.850 --> 09:51.320
Is it such a bad thing to 
let me live a normal life?

09:51.320 --> 09:52.610
Yes, it is.

09:52.610 --> 09:55.540
You must live your life as the Hero.

09:55.540 --> 10:00.200
The Almighty and all humanity won't 
allow the Hero to lead a peaceful life.

10:00.560 --> 10:03.200
I'm not sure the Almighty will allow it.

10:08.990 --> 10:10.640
So this is where Gideon lives!

10:10.640 --> 10:12.680
Looks like they're out.

10:12.680 --> 10:15.690
Must've skipped work to go on a date.

10:15.690 --> 10:17.170
Any idea where they could've gone?

10:17.480 --> 10:21.360
How would I know? I held up my end 
of the deal, so let me go now.

10:21.360 --> 10:22.680
Hey, Godwin!

10:22.680 --> 10:24.550
I knew it was you!

10:24.550 --> 10:26.280
You've got the wrong person.

10:26.280 --> 10:27.810
You're not fooling anyone.

10:27.810 --> 10:31.440
I heard you'd broken out of prison, 
but I didn't expect you to waltz back into Zoltan!

10:31.750 --> 10:36.040
He broke out? I was told that he was
 friends with Rit and Red's, though.

10:36.040 --> 10:38.200
A friend? Not in a million years.

10:38.540 --> 10:41.930
He's a criminal who had demons 
attack the Champion Rit,

10:41.930 --> 10:46.440
and abducted a child Red and Rit had taken 
under their wing, among other misdeeds!

10:46.440 --> 10:47.580
Is that true?

10:48.360 --> 10:50.460
Did you also betray him?

10:50.460 --> 10:51.940
"Also"?

10:51.940 --> 10:56.240
Y-You've got it all wrong! 
Sure, we did butt heads at one point, but...

10:58.470 --> 11:01.340
H-Hear me out, please!

11:03.270 --> 11:04.760
W-Wait!

11:07.770 --> 11:09.350
I-It's you!

11:09.350 --> 11:12.510
Godwin, what did you do this time?

11:12.510 --> 11:14.600
Not a single thing!

11:14.600 --> 11:18.790
That Yarandrala woman just 
thinks I'm an enemy of Red's!

11:18.790 --> 11:19.860
"Yarandrala"?

11:24.030 --> 11:26.180
Traitors must be brought to justice.

11:26.810 --> 11:32.210
O great monarch of the forests of old! 
Ruler of mana, origin of all!

11:45.090 --> 11:48.970
<i>Uh, timeout! No need to go 
all scorched earth on us!</i>

11:48.970 --> 11:53.610
Y-You idiot! What are you doing, 
summoning something that huge here?!

11:53.610 --> 11:55.360
<i>Don't provoke her, Lensman!</i>

12:01.030 --> 12:04.380
If someone's running wild here, 
then as a Zoltan adventurer,

12:04.380 --> 12:06.090
I have a responsibility to stop them!

12:10.580 --> 12:12.210
<i>I can't get close enough!</i>

12:16.040 --> 12:19.050
O polar winds, O life-stealing chill!

12:19.410 --> 12:20.760
Blizzard!

12:27.970 --> 12:31.480
Gran—I mean, Miss Mistrom!

12:31.480 --> 12:32.570
Do you know her?

12:32.570 --> 12:34.230
She used to be Zoltan's mayor.

12:34.230 --> 12:37.100
For some reason, even the Guild's 
brass think she's something special.

12:37.100 --> 12:40.440
I'm just a retired old 
coot now. That aside...

12:40.860 --> 12:43.400
Looks like my magic isn't 
enough to stop that thing.

12:43.660 --> 12:46.530
I'll stop her. Could you back me up?

12:46.530 --> 12:47.920
Yes, of course.

13:06.290 --> 13:07.670
Who are you?

13:07.670 --> 13:10.080
A friend of Red and Rit's.

13:10.080 --> 13:11.720
I don't believe you.

13:11.720 --> 13:14.600
Then why don't you go ask them yourself?

13:14.600 --> 13:18.190
They left for the Wall at the 
World's End this morning.

13:20.200 --> 13:21.860
For what purpose?

13:22.230 --> 13:26.320
Red's looking for a gemstone to 
put in the ring he's giving Rit.

13:26.320 --> 13:29.280
Ring? Is that true?

13:29.540 --> 13:30.320
It is.

13:37.030 --> 13:42.130
I see those two are as close as ever.

13:42.130 --> 13:45.630
You had better fix this mess 
before you go, however.

13:54.140 --> 13:56.860
Hey, are you sure about this?

13:56.860 --> 13:57.640
About what?

13:57.640 --> 14:01.150
Tiny as they are, 
zoogs are man-eating monsters!

14:02.700 --> 14:07.390
They do attack people at times, 
but they're not going to hurt us.

14:07.390 --> 14:09.380
I'm friends with their elder.

14:09.380 --> 14:12.650
Red's always got the strangest connections.

14:12.650 --> 14:15.010
It even surprises me sometimes.

14:15.010 --> 14:17.760
Zoogs know a lot about the 
Wall at the World's End,

14:17.760 --> 14:20.080
so they should know where the 
gem giants' settlement is.

14:20.450 --> 14:23.040
It'sh been a while, Red.

14:23.040 --> 14:25.310
It's good to see you alive and well, Elder.

14:25.310 --> 14:28.000
I know it'sh a long way from Zoltan,

14:28.000 --> 14:30.670
but I wish you would shtop by now and then.

14:30.670 --> 14:32.700
I'm sorry for being away so long.

14:32.700 --> 14:35.760
I, uh, have had a hard time 
getting away from Zoltan.

14:35.760 --> 14:37.900
You've married? That'sh wonderful.

14:37.900 --> 14:40.310
Well, not quite. Though we do plan to.

14:40.310 --> 14:44.070
May your future together and 
our friendship be blesshed.

14:44.380 --> 14:46.070
Indeed. Oh, right.

14:46.680 --> 14:49.070
I've brought you some homemade ham as a gift.

14:49.070 --> 14:54.030
Ooh, we're very grateful. 
We can never get enough meat.

14:54.030 --> 14:58.000
If only we could undershtand busshinesh.

14:58.330 --> 15:02.720
So, Elder, we were hoping 
to see the gem giants.

15:02.720 --> 15:05.830
Could you tell us where their settlement is?

15:05.830 --> 15:10.190
I would be happy to, but pleashe be careful.

15:10.760 --> 15:14.340
The gem giantsh have been 
acting shtrange lately.

15:14.340 --> 15:17.220
They sheem to be angry.

15:17.220 --> 15:18.280
Angry?

15:18.280 --> 15:22.390
Yesh. We don't know the reashon, 
so pleashe be cautioush.

15:22.390 --> 15:23.380
Got it.

15:24.480 --> 15:26.250
What'sh wrong?

15:26.250 --> 15:30.110
He fell from the tree. Itsh branch broke.

15:30.110 --> 15:31.870
C'mon, it wash just a tumble!

15:31.870 --> 15:32.850
Are you okay?

15:32.850 --> 15:35.830
Oh, he'll be fine. Don't worry!

15:36.170 --> 15:39.320
I'm better! Thanksh, lady!

15:38.470 --> 15:40.560
This tree appears to be weakened.

15:40.560 --> 15:42.380
That must be why the branch snapped.

15:42.380 --> 15:45.370
The other trees around here don't 
look to be doing great, either.

15:45.370 --> 15:46.590
You can tell?

15:47.110 --> 15:51.340
The spirits told me.
 I don't know the cause, though.

15:51.630 --> 15:54.050
Red, can you make some fertilizer?

15:54.050 --> 15:57.350
Yeah. I can cook something 
up with the materials here.

15:57.350 --> 16:02.400
Great. It'll only be a temporary solution, 
but let's try doing what we can.

16:02.400 --> 16:03.850
Will that be all right, Elder?

16:03.850 --> 16:07.480
Of courshe! Pleashe do!

16:24.250 --> 16:26.250
What's on your mind?

16:26.560 --> 16:28.750
Rit... Well...

16:29.030 --> 16:31.260
Not the ring, I assume?

16:33.290 --> 16:36.010
I was thinking about Ruti's Blessing.

16:38.580 --> 16:39.720
Right now,

16:40.280 --> 16:43.230
her "New Truth" Blessing is canceling out

16:43.230 --> 16:47.710
the Hero Blessing's tendency to strip 
one of their will and individuality.

16:47.710 --> 16:49.980
That's something she's always wanted.

16:50.400 --> 16:54.820
She'd had the joy of life 
taken away from her.

16:54.820 --> 16:59.490
She never tired, and she 
didn't need to eat or sleep.

17:00.140 --> 17:04.550
I don't think "New Truth" is something 
she received from the Almighty.

17:04.550 --> 17:07.130
It's probably something 
that came from within her.

17:07.130 --> 17:09.500
And I don't know how or why that happened.

17:10.130 --> 17:11.000
Red...

17:12.820 --> 17:14.950
There's so much I don't know,

17:14.950 --> 17:18.290
but I do know that I will 
always be on Ruti's side.

17:18.290 --> 17:19.010
Yeah.

17:19.530 --> 17:21.490
I'm rooting for her, too.

17:26.090 --> 17:27.330
What's the matter?

17:27.330 --> 17:29.700
Something's wrong with the plant life here.

17:30.360 --> 17:33.110
The farther we walk, the sicker they get.

17:33.110 --> 17:35.050
It's like the soil around here has gone bad.

17:35.050 --> 17:36.920
The soil?

17:36.920 --> 17:40.660
Indeed. Something might be 
happening up in the mountains.

17:42.030 --> 17:46.770
Anyway, we should probably set up
 camp around here for tonight.

17:46.770 --> 17:48.010
Understood.

17:50.690 --> 17:51.570
Tell me something.

17:51.570 --> 17:52.710
What is it?

17:52.710 --> 17:55.480
Why did you come with me?

17:55.480 --> 17:57.220
To show you the way.

17:57.790 --> 18:00.470
There was no need for you 
to come all this way.

18:00.720 --> 18:02.710
No real reason.

18:03.400 --> 18:08.930
If I had to say, it's because I heard 
the Wall has natural hot springs.

18:10.170 --> 18:11.230
Is that all?

18:11.950 --> 18:13.230
That is all.

18:14.360 --> 18:14.980
I see.

18:15.740 --> 18:19.930
<i>Yarandrala doesn't know that 
Ruti is with Red and Rit.</i>

18:20.580 --> 18:24.990
<i>How will she react when she learns 
that Ruti quit being the Hero?</i>

18:24.990 --> 18:27.690
Uh, can I ask you something?

18:27.690 --> 18:28.670
What?

18:28.950 --> 18:32.770
Why did you become one 
of the Hero's companions?

18:32.770 --> 18:34.800
So, you know who I am?

18:35.550 --> 18:40.430
Yes. Because I'm friends with Red 
and Rit, and one other person.

18:40.720 --> 18:44.430
Which means I'm not mistaken 
about Red's true identity.

18:44.430 --> 18:46.680
Correct. It's Gideon.

18:46.680 --> 18:51.190
I was sure of it, but it's 
still nice to get confirmation.

18:51.850 --> 18:54.440
Thank goodness. He really is alive.

18:55.050 --> 18:59.450
You want to know why I joined 
the Hero? It's simple.

18:59.450 --> 19:02.800
Because my dear friend, Gideon, was there.

19:02.800 --> 19:04.200
That's all?

19:04.520 --> 19:06.140
Yes, that's all.

19:06.970 --> 19:10.580
What reason could I possibly need 
other than to help a friend?

19:12.470 --> 19:16.100
Sure, I would've liked to save the world.

19:16.100 --> 19:19.730
And if I could help people 
in need, nothing like it.

19:19.730 --> 19:24.670
But that wasn't reason enough to attempt to 
defeat the demon lord with a party of six.

19:24.670 --> 19:26.810
That was quite simply absurd.

19:26.810 --> 19:28.280
Absurd?

19:28.730 --> 19:33.840
Very. Why intentionally 
fight with so few people?

19:33.840 --> 19:37.020
The Hero carries the world on her shoulders.

19:37.020 --> 19:39.760
If she were to fall, 
it would spell total doom.

19:39.760 --> 19:42.740
Leaving things up to her is 
a nonsensical risk to take.

19:43.190 --> 19:47.990
So, would you say that there is no need for 
the Hero to keep fighting for the world?

19:49.940 --> 19:51.000
I see now.

19:51.970 --> 19:56.190
Don't worry. I feel the same way as Gideon.

19:56.780 --> 19:58.650
Still, that's quite the surprise.

20:02.390 --> 20:04.050
Ruti's here, too, isn't she?

20:14.230 --> 20:15.190
Brr!

20:15.190 --> 20:17.360
What say we bring back the old special?

20:17.360 --> 20:17.980
Yeah!

20:23.290 --> 20:24.700
Listen, Ruti.

20:25.500 --> 20:27.800
Live your life the way you want.

20:27.800 --> 20:30.660
It doesn't matter if the 
Almighty won't stand for it.

20:31.080 --> 20:32.910
I've always got your back.

20:34.430 --> 20:36.920
Okay. Thanks, Big Brother.

20:37.920 --> 20:39.420
Ruti.

20:41.910 --> 20:43.630
Tisse? Why are you here?

20:55.600 --> 20:56.800
Gideon!

21:12.690 --> 21:14.540
Excellent work, Van.

21:14.540 --> 21:19.460
What did you expect? Van could take 
monsters like this in his sleep!

21:20.630 --> 21:22.920
If only we had arrived sooner...

21:23.230 --> 21:25.760
There wouldn't have been any casualties.

21:26.170 --> 21:28.260
No need to be sad.

21:28.550 --> 21:32.010
This is simply the fulfillment of
 the roles the Almighty has given.

21:32.010 --> 21:32.770
What?

21:33.250 --> 21:37.680
This owlbear's Blessing bound it to 
the fate of attacking this person.

21:37.680 --> 21:41.830
And this person, in turn, 
was fated to lose his life to it.

21:41.830 --> 21:45.110
They each had roles to play, 
and they played them to completion.

21:45.420 --> 21:48.070
How could getting killed be his "role"?

21:48.330 --> 21:53.570
But it was. He lived and died 
according to Lord Demis's will.

21:53.570 --> 21:57.080
They deserve praise, not pity.

21:59.500 --> 22:04.010
And I will grow stronger 
thanks to their sacrifice.

22:04.530 --> 22:08.750
All to fulfill my role as Hero 
and rid this world of evil!
